# B&B Sample Diet PDF (`bbsamplediet.pdf`)

**Deliverable filename:** `docs/samples/bbsamplediet.pdf` — stable name, no special characters (Mac Downloads–safe). Overwritten each render.

**Pages:** Welcome → Lean Body Analysis → Food Plan → Servings → Food List (protein/grains) → Food List (vegetables/fruit) — **6 pages**.

When the user asks for **sample diet**, **sample-female**, or **bbsamplediet** work, use this pipeline.

## Pipeline

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Renderer | `server/pdf/renderSampleDietPrintout.js` |
| Frame / header | `server/pdf/draw1982Frame.js` |
| Food list pages | `server/pdf/drawStaplesFoodListPages.js` |
| Payload | `js/sampleDietPrintoutData.js` → `buildSampleDietPreviewPayload()` |
| Copy | `js/sampleDietPrintoutCopyData.js` |
| Preview fixtures | `js/sampleDietPreviewFixtures.js` |
| Render script | `scripts/render-sample-diet-preview.mjs` |
| Deliverable | `docs/samples/bbsamplediet.pdf` |

Run: `npm run render:sample-diet-preview`

## Delivery order (critical — tell the user)

The download link is a **raw GitHub URL**. It serves whatever is **committed on `main`**.

**Required order every time:**

1. Edit renderer / payload / copy
2. `npm run render:sample-diet-preview`
3. **Commit** `docs/samples/bbsamplediet.pdf` (and code changes)
4. **`git push origin main`**
5. **Only then** paste the download link

Say explicitly: *“Pushed to main — tap this link; it saves to Downloads as `bbsamplediet.pdf`.”*

If tap-to-download still opens in the browser, give the **Terminal one-liner** (Mac):

```bash
curl -L -o ~/Downloads/bbsamplediet.pdf "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/koryedwards-del/landing-burn-and-build/main/docs/samples/bbsamplediet.pdf"
```

## Give the user (one link only)

```
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/koryedwards-del/landing-burn-and-build/main/docs/samples/bbsamplediet.pdf
```

- **No `&` in filename** — `b&bsamplediet.pdf` breaks many Mac/Safari downloads.
- Do not link before push.

## Do not

| Wrong | Why |
|-------|-----|
| Link before push | GitHub still serves old bytes |
| `&` in deliverable filename | Mac Downloads often fails |
| Cursor artifacts panel | Broken download UX on Cursor Web |
| `github.com/.../blob/...` | Opens browser; does not download |

## Sanity check after render

**6 pages**, ~70 KB, Times fonts, full header every page, food lists without tips.
